window.products.push({"id":590037,"name":"Gothswin Boho Pillow Covers 18x18 Inch, Colorful Modern Abstraction Decorative Throw Pillows,Mid Century Soft Cotton Tufted Cushion Cover for Couch Be","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9147io-xBHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton 【Boho Chic Design】You will get one piece of this pillow cover, 18 x 18 inch(45x45cm) (Note: no inserts included); has a casual and vibrant color combination, tufting craftsmanship, and 3D color block patterns that surly it will add a glam of modern boho chic to your decor. 【Comfortable & Durable Fabric】Our textured blue boho throw pillow covers are made with natural cotton base and high-end woven embroidery, making them thick, soft, and aesthetically pleasing, a hidden zipper strongly hand stitched on one side which will endure long-lasting uses, and the 3D color block minimalist embroidery is only available on the front side. 【Exquisite Workmanship】Our boho pillow covers are made with premium quality invisible zippers and strong seams that won't easily damage. 【Perfect Decoration】Our accent boho pillow covers with abstract geometric marble patterns are perfect for various home styles, including modern, retro, rustic, urban, boho chic, farmhouse, Nordic, and mid-century. They also make great digital art gifts for friends and family for birthdays, weddings, anniversaries, and housewarmings. 【Washing Tips】For the mid century textured blue boho pillow cases, we recommend avoiding a long time soaking,machine washable. Dry at low temperature or hang to dry,do not bleach,and do not iron. Due to package reasons,there might be some crease marks on your pillowcases,which is normal,creases can be easily removed by washing. 【Service and guarantee】 If you're not satisfied with our product, please contact us, we will provide you with worry-free service and guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9147io-xBHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gothswin","source_asin":"B0BL97X81V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-590037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL97X81V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL97X81V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
