window.products.push({"id":590088,"name":"Large Insulated Lunch Bag Women Men Dual Compartment Reusable Lunch Box Soft Portable Leakproof Cooler Bag with Removable Adjustable Shoulder Strap (M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aUyXqZ80L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Expandable Lunch Bag for Women: Before Expanded dimension: 9.6L*10.2W*7.4D inch, Expanded dimension: 11.3L*10.2W*7.4D inch; Heavy duty fabric construction build to long-lasting, perfect for carrying lunch to office, school, picnic, car trip, travel, park, kayaking and outdoors. Dual compartment lunch bag: Two insulated section allows to pack hot food separated from cold food, top section perfect for non-leaking items like fruit, snack; Bottom Large Compartment is no-leak insulated with soft PEVA liner, perfect for cooling drinks, juice, etc. Three Carrying Options: Reusable lunch box features durable handle and comes with a removable and adjustable shoulder strap. Providing three options to carry: shoulder bag, oblique bag or fashion hand bag. At the same time, we use a high quality zipper which will minimize the possibility of broken zipper. Multiple Pockets Reusable Lunch Box: 2 main storage section; 1 front zipper pocket and 1 back pocket for utensils, napkins, keys, cards and other small stuffs; 2 sides open pocket for the things need easy access. Large Insulated Lunch Bag with Luggage Sleeve, You can also easily take it to the airport or terminal when you travel. Leakproof and Waterproof: Extra thick soft EVA liner and the heat-welded seams to guard against leaks and easy to clean. If sauce spills inside, just wipe it off with wet cloth or napkins. Premium composite waterproof fabric is resistant to dirty and abrasion, protecting your lunch and items inside from occasional splatters or light rain. Personalized design: Wide-Open-Design Which means you can put your lunch container into the bag and taken out of the bag horizontally. Wide open design is for easy access and it can prevent liquids from leaking out of the container and soiling inside the bag, which will saves your cleaning time. Note：Not for children under 3 year","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aUyXqZ80L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAMTOP","source_asin":"B09N97YS9R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-590088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N97YS9R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N97YS9R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
