window.products.push({"id":590343,"name":"CITOLEN Motorized Blinds with Valance Cover Upgraded Smart Blinds Grasscloth Fabric Electric Blinds Remote Control Automatic Roller Shades for Windows","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qcAP5yezL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NEW TECHNOLOGY MOTORIZED BLINDS WITH REMOTE: Today you have the opportunity to upgrade your traditional blinds to a remote control blinds! You can easily control the privacy and light of any high or hard-to-reach window with a remote. Motorized window blinds are perfect for hard-to-reach windows, no need for any steps or ladders. If you choose these motorized blinds, you'll be free to just lie back and raise or lower the blinds to the length you want. BEST PRIVACY FOR MOTORIZED BLINDS: When the motorized blinds gets a smart hub, they can be easily upgraded to be smart blinds. This is a feature that can be a huge benefit to your home, and these smart blinds are definitely worth considering as your next investment in your home. In addition to being easily integrated into the home automation ecosystem, in addition they become ideal for master bedrooms, playrooms and conference rooms, especially if you are looking for optimal privacy. UPGRADE TO SMART BLINDS: Now you have the chance to upgrade with just need a smart hub. Loved by high-tech lovers. You can get it from the ''Smart HUB'' option. With this smart hub, you can control smart blinds remotely with a phone, even with your voice. It is compatible with all models of Alexa and Google Assistant. When you cook, not need to wipe your hands and get the remote. Just say: \"Alexa/Google, open the blinds.\" More suitable for people with disabilities, children, and the elderly. CORDLESS DESIGN & VALANCE DESIGN: Cordless electric blinds with valance are safer than manual ones. Your children, your pets, or even your own hands can get caught by cords of manual blinds. Use battery-operated electric blinds solution to prevent it. They look neater and more elegant than manual roller shades. We provide you with a useful valance to cover the gap between the top rail and the roller. motorized blinds with valance and no cord give your windows a clean and modern look. MEASUREMENT & INSTALLATION: You may choose inside or outside mount, according to your demands and window types. For inside mount,the window frame depth should be ≥ 2\", and the order width should be 1/4\" less than the window width. And for outside mount, the order width should be at least 4\" longer than the window width. No matter which mount, you don't have to worry about the height of motorized blinds with remote. It can be adjusted from 0\" to 72\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qcAP5yezL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CITOLEN","source_asin":"B0BMQQKCN1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-590343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMQQKCN1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMQQKCN1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
