window.products.push({"id":590356,"name":"Displays2go Clear Acrylic Hanging Magazine Rack with Adjustable Pockets, 29x35\" (RP9CLR)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518pqK5v3yL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This hanging magazine rack keeps literature organized while on display in an office, lobby or foyer. The wall-mounted brochure holder is constructed from clear acrylic and features 3 rows in which a user can store an assortment of magazines or pamphlets. The hanging magazine rack is equipped with removable dividers, thus giving users the ability to alter the width of each pocket within the 3 rows. Leave the dividers in place to have up to 18 pockets for 4 by 9 inch brochures. The hanging magazine rack can also have up to 9 individual sections for 8.5 by 11 inch magazines. The wall-mounted display fixture is therefore completely customizable. This hanging magazine rack provides guests and viewers with a clear view of the displayed literature. Clear acrylic is also incredibly durable and long-lasting. Mounting hardware included with every purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518pqK5v3yL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Displays2go","source_asin":"B00649OC9Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-590356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00649OC9Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00649OC9Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":590357,"name":"Ling's moment Buffalo Plaid Fabric Tassel Garland, Lace Burlap Rig Tie Banner, Baby Shower Decorations, Shabby Chic Garland Rag Tie Banner, 4FT (Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FL2ZZSFpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The lace and ribbon make up 2 feet when bunched together but the cotton cord is 9 feet long from end to end. Lace hangs approx 12-15 inches long. The lace is securely attached but is easy to move along the cotton cording so you can customize the length. Spread the lace out or bunch it together for a thicker look! This would look pretty as a backdrop for a garden wedding, as a photo prop, or for that special little girls room. There are so many possibilities for this beautiful garland. It instantly glams up any occasion or space. Your garland will be very similar to the picture but actual lace may differ in pattern depending on stock","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FL2ZZSFpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ling's Moment","source_asin":"B074YYHCSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-590357","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074YYHCSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074YYHCSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
