window.products.push({"id":590362,"name":"JSLOVE Shower Curtain with Snap-in Liner Set for Bathroom, Sequin Fabric Shower Curtains Waterproof Shimmery Color Block Design 72\" X 72\" (White and B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iQye1b5lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SHOWER CURTAIN SET - 100% Polyester Bathroom sets with include 1 × Quick-drying sequin shower curtain, 1 × Removable inner lining, 12 × metal hooks. SEQUINED AND REMOVABLE LINER DESIGN - Firmly encases each piece of sequins to add a sophisticated and trendy look to your bathroom that will look great in any bathroom.Shower curtain with a removable water repellent fabric liner, detachable for washing without taking the whole curtain down, makes keeping it clean and beautiful. WATER RESISTANT & TEAR RESISTANT - Our shower curtains are waterproof and the weighted bottom line provides weight and greater stability to help keep water inside the tub. Reinforced Removable inner lining and Premium Quality Fabric made it tear-resistant. So you no longer have to change your shower curtain frequently. EASY CARE - Due to the delicate material of the shower curtain, we recommend hand washing or dry cleaning for durability. For daily cleaning, the inside fabric liner can be removed and machine washed, easy and labor-saving. EASY TO INSTALL - We gift 12 hooks free for you. So you don't have to worry about how to install these bathroom sets. This is a great choice for decorating your bathroom with a wonderful modern style with this shower curtain.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iQye1b5lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JSLOVE","source_asin":"B0B8QY38S1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-590362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8QY38S1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8QY38S1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":590363,"name":"Strobel Organic Waterbed Mattress Sleep Easy Supreme Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":215.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A8VEmwxeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Century water mattress feature full 20 mil American Made vinyl (10% thicker than many who claim 20 mil but actually use 18 mil), Strobel One-Piece Watermattress Construction, 3 layer densified fiber waveless system. Fiber is thermally bonded for longest life, not resin bonded. (Cheaper adhesive resin bonding can break down over time in water.) Reinforced corners. Fits standard wood type waterbed frames 60 by 84-inch ID. If you dont already have a frame, frame building instructions included. Made in USA. Strobel waterbeds are naturally fire resistant and do not require flame retardant chemical based flame barriers like other mattresses to comply with federal fire safety regulations. Our bodies are over 90% water. Strobel waterbeds achieve nearly Zero-Gravity. Archimedes Principle, proved a body floating or submerged in a liquid is buoyed up by a force equal to the weight of the liquid displaced. Thus the human body loses the amount of weight of the liquid displaced so that your body is lightened. This imposes less pressure on the body. Many people rave about the health benefits and how well they sleep on Strobel Waterbeds. Made in USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A8VEmwxeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Strobel Organic","source_asin":"B001P5GAZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-590363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001P5GAZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001P5GAZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
