window.products.push({"id":590687,"name":"Pacific Merchants Acaciaware 10.5-by 7.25-by .75-Inch Acacia Wood Rectangle Serving Tray, 1 EA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hhFY0mplL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether you're looking for a gift to give or a gift for yourself; whether you're looking for something for the holidays, special occasions or every day use, Acaciaware is an exceptional choice. The Acaciaware Rectangular Tray with Round Corners is perfectly sized for serving sides and appetizers. It measures 10.5 by 7.25-inch. Acaciaware, by Pacific Merchants, is the highest quality and best valued Acacia woodenware available on the market; the bowls are hand turned from one solid piece of Acacia hardwood and the serving pieces are hand carved, making each one a unique, sculptured work of art! Acaciaware is a dense, naturally resinous hardwood which, by its very nature, resists penetration by water and will not absorb stains or odors. Acaciaware also means \"easy care\". Hand wash with warm soapy water and air dry. It doesn’t typically require oil but, if for some reason it appears to be drying out, simply use a non-toxic mineral oil to restore the wood grain to its original beauty. Creating high quality woodenware is not Pacific Merchants only concern, they are also concerned about the environment. Their wood sources do not harm the environment by using \"slash and burn\" methods of harvesting trees. All of their wood is \"harvested with care\" meaning that the trees they use are harvested legally from privately owned lands, which are highly regulated and monitored by the government. Pacific Merchants cares about sustaining the environment and are constantly looking for wood sources.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hhFY0mplL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PACIFIC MERCHANTS","source_asin":"B001TH896A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-590687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001TH896A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001TH896A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":590688,"name":"EEEKit Heavy Duty Suction Cups 4 Pcs with Hooks, Outdoor Red Car Camping Tie Down Suction Cup, 22Lbs Large Camping Tarp Accessory Strong Power for Awn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KwEhoTwlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DURABLE MATERIAL: This heavy duty suction cup anchor is made of high-quality ABS and PVC materials, strong and durable, scratch-resistant and lightweight. Each anchor can bear a weight of 22 pounds/10kg, which is especially suitable for outdoor travel or home use. EASY TO USE: You only need to place the strong suction cup on a non-porous smooth surface, and the rotating handle is locked so that the suction cup can be firmly absorbed without damaging the surface. Please keep the handle slack when not in use. Please note that the surface is smooth and clean when using it. REUSABLE: When the anti-slip mat of this suction cups anchor is stuck with dust and the suction is not enough, you can wash it with clean water, and then it will return to normal. Tips: Use on a wet and smooth surface will make the suction cup anchor stronger. WIDELY USE: This suction cup can hang and fix almost anything. You can build side awning on the side of your car. You can tie down a camping tarp while traveling. This is an excellent car and boat camping tarp accessories. You can even use it to hang clothes in your home, or to fix your pet leash. PACKAGE INCLUDED: You will receive a total of 4 pcs suction cup anchor with securing hook and 4 carabiners. You can use this suction cup set on various occasions. The carabiner is convenient for you to extend the shoulder strap of the suction cup and fix the rope.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KwEhoTwlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EEEKit","source_asin":"B09K7CBD2D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-590688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K7CBD2D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K7CBD2D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
