window.products.push({"id":590691,"name":"UTOI Kitchen Knife Sharpener, 2-Stage Manual Knife Sharpening Tool with Tungsten Steel and Ceramic Rod Helps Repair, Restore and Polish Dull Blades fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lUrcoYlZL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"With UTOI knife sharpener, you can sharpen a dull knife in seconds and enjoy a razor sharp. Note: To sharpen ceramic knives, please use only the ceramic FINE smoothing rods (white in color), or the knives could be damaged! Specifications: Brand: UTOI Model No.: UBMD01 Color: Silver+Black Material: ABS+Stainless Steel+EVA Weight: 239g(0.527lb) Dimension: 20.5*6*6.5cm (8.07*2.37*2.56in) Box Dimension: 21*7*6.5cm(8.27*2.76*2.56in) How to sharpen your knife? 1. Insert the blade into the slot at a 90-degree angle to the sharpener. 2. Place the blade in carbide cutting heads (Black in color), pull the knife straight back towards you (2-3 times) while applying a light pressure. 3. Place the blade in ceramic fine smoothing rods (White in color), pull the knife straight back towards you (5-6 times) while applying a heavy pressure. 4. If the blade is still dull, repeat the steps above until the blade is sharp. Caution: Always place the sharpener on a sturdy flat surface, never on leg and keep fingers behind the finger guard, or injury could occur! Clean : Clean the carbide cutting heads and the ceramic rod with a soft brush to keep the sharpener head clean. Package includes: 1 x Knife Sharpener 1 x Cut Resistant Glove","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lUrcoYlZL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UTOI","source_asin":"B07MKK4L2G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-590691","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MKK4L2G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MKK4L2G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
