window.products.push({"id":590734,"name":"Ceiling LAMINATED STICKER MURAL leaves trees spring forest airly decole poster 93\"x93\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51u10p9v0aL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazing illusion for your interior! High quality self-adhesive peel and stick mural. Consists of 3 sheets. Comes in a tube.  If you need CUSTOM size just write us! High quality washable vinyl, waterproof inks and a UV protective coating gives us a longevity rating of many years. Stickerbrand wall murals DO NOT need glue, paste or any special chemicals, they come with self adhesive backing. Simply peel and apply on your walls. The decals can be applied to all smooth surfaces, such as ceilings, walls, windows, tiles, mirrors and doors. Application is fun and easy. Using only a plastic card, like a credit card or a plastic squeegee.   How to Install Murals  1. Clean your ceiling or other surface. Be sure it is smooth, dry and free of dust and dirt.  2. Measure the ceiling.  3. Unpack and spread out the graphic sheets on a flat surface.  4. Cut the graphic sheet to size if you need.  5. Start from a corner and gently roll the white backing from the transfer sheet. Make sure that none of the sticker pieces is left on the backing paper.  6. Face the self-adhesive side of the sticker down on the location that you desire and apply even, firm pressure to ensure complete removal of any bubbles.  7. Bubbling may occur after the graphics are applied. Simply take a thumbtack or needle and poke the bubbled area a couple of times, then smooth it out with your hands.  Trackable shipping takes 3-4 weeks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51u10p9v0aL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pulaton","source_asin":"B00JCUVX8M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-590734","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JCUVX8M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JCUVX8M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":590735,"name":"Superior Luxurious Soft Velour Absorbent Terry Thick Plush Striped Oversized Beach Towel, 34\" x 64\", Faded","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pKVUZKS0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Affordable Luxury Linens This towel is essential for summer fun at the beach or in the backyard. Made of thick cotton, this thirsty beach towel dries quickly without fading. It reverses from a soft velour side to an absorbent loop terry side, keeping you warm and dry. Our extra large beach towels are available in a wide variety of fun styles and bright colors from nautical and patriotic designs perfect for a Fourth of July pool party, to cute creature beach towels for girls and boys, and classic stripes and polka dots, an easy choice for all beachgoers.  These beach towels, oversized at 34\" x 64\", are great for adults and kids, and can even be used as a beach blanket or beach chair cover. Our luxurious jacquard construction means that these towels are not printed, so they're much softer than a screenprinted towel, and they will not fade in the wash. Superior's oversize beach towels will soon become your family's favorite, and will last for years to come. Heritage We have been manufacturing fine linens for over 40 years. We make everything from towels and bath robes, to comforters and mattress toppers, sheets, duvets, pillowcases, and bedskirts, and even area rugs. Our wide range of colors, patterns, and price points ensures that every one of our customers will be able to find something they'll love. We are experts in manufacturing high quality textiles and pride ourselves on only producing the finest products. See what our customers have to say: \"These are the greatest towels, large and thick!\" \"Thick enough, but not too thick; it could fold up and fit into a standard sized beach tote bag without filling the entire space\" \"Aaahhhhh another lovely towel with a beautiful design and vibrant colors. I love this one and the extra size is great. Perfect for the beach and the pool. Soft and cuddly\" \"Absolutely gorgeous towel! Excellent quality! It's kitten soft on the \"Velour\" side and standard terry cloth on the terry side. And it's BIG! I was concerned that the velour side would not be very absorbent but no - it sucks up water like a sponge and feels silky smooth on your skin! I was so pleased I ordered a 2nd one!\" \"this is a huge, wraparound, fairly heavy looped terry cloth towel work of art. recommend. 10 stars\" And try them for yourself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pKVUZKS0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERIOR","source_asin":"B074F1VVMQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-590735","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074F1VVMQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074F1VVMQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
