window.products.push({"id":590761,"name":"Cosmetic Grade Beeswax Tealight Candles, Eucalyptus, Lemongrass Essential Oil's for Uplifting Aromatherapy, 5 Hour Burn Time, All Natural Ingredients ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bcLt+2sCL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beeswax creates a special candle that may be perfect for your lifestyle and health needs. I will quickly touch on the health benefits of our beeswax tea lights. Please keep in mind that we use the highest quality cosmetic grade organic beeswax that truly smells of honey, all natural non-toxic wicks, the same therapeutic grade essential oils used in our handmade soap, and like our soap we feel that these are the highest quality candles available on the market. Beeswax is the all-natural, non-toxic waxy substance secreted by bees after they consume honey. Bees use this wax to construct their honeycombs, and when cleaned and filtered, it can be used for beautiful and beneficial candles. Pure Beeswax Candles burn with almost no smoke or scent and clean the air by releasing negative ions. These negative ions can bind with toxins and help remove them from the air. Many people prefer beeswax candles to paraffin candles because as an all-natural product, and they are more attractive to individuals who practice a vegan or vegetarian lifestyle. Beeswax candles can be helpful for those with asthma or allergies, because they are effective at removing common allergens like dust and dander from the air. Beeswax candles also burn more slowly than paraffin candles so they last much longer. Paraffin candles on the other hand all though they seem safe, they are a huge source of indoor air pollution and they put off chemicals that are considered just as dangerous as second-hand smoke. Unfortunately, most candles are made of paraffin and on top of that, many fragrance or scented candles also have wicks that contain heavy metals like lead, and even a few hours of burning they can create levels of airborne heavy metals that are much higher than the acceptable limits. In the US, candle wicks are supposed to be made of cotton or paper, but studies have found that as much as 30% of candles contain heavy metals in the wicks. Our candles are pure and natural, made to enjoy a healthy lifestyle","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bcLt+2sCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon marketplace","source_asin":"B08B5K7473","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-590761","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B5K7473","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B5K7473","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
