window.products.push({"id":590830,"name":"PJ Wood 29-Inch Round Seat Kitchen Counter Height Stool - Natural, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q-LxOCTkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Two are better than one when it comes to this pair of backless, comfortable, round seating counter stools brought to you by PJ Wood. They’re 29 inches in height, which is the perfect size for standard counters and they’re a bit of modern with a lot of classic when it comes to style. They’re made from long-lasting, high-quality materials. Comfortable Seating You always want to be comfortable when you’re at home, so comfortable seating is a top priority. With these backless bar stools, you’re bound to sit nicely with not just one, but two, comfortable stools. They also contain two levels of built-in bars for stepping on and off, as well as leaning your feet. Included Parts: Two round seatsLegsToolsHardware Classic Design Kitchen counter stools are like any piece of furniture. They have to match with the existing items in your home, in addition to the style factor that currently resides. With these bar height stools, you can’t go wrong. They collectively feature a classic design with a little contemporary style sprinkled in, which is bound to blend in nicely with your present decor. Long-Lasting Durability When it comes to the construction of any item, especially when you’re dealing with furniture, you want the best for your buck, and an item, or in this case, two items, which will last a long time. You need products you can rely on for their long-lasting, sturdiness, and durability factors. These bar stools each hold up to 225 lbs. Multifunctional These counter height stools can work well in various spaces in your home. They go great with any bar or kitchen. When you don’t want to sit at the table, be sure to sit at the bar. For a drink or a meal, grab a partner and enjoy your food or beverages together.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q-LxOCTkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PJ Wood","source_asin":"B07GP5H9VT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-590830","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GP5H9VT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GP5H9VT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
