window.products.push({"id":590922,"name":"Pasta Maker Attachments for KitchenAid Mixer Accessories, Including Pasta Sheet Roller Spaghetti Fettuccine Cutter, Press Noodle Maker Machine for Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TLQ-abzPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Fit KitchenAid Stand Mixers Perfectly】3 Pieces Pasta maker attachment are suitable for KitchenAid stand mixers. Compared with the pasta made by the integrated pasta machine, the pasta made by the pasta machine attachment is more chewy.Pasta maker attachments are compatible with Kitchenaid / Cuisinart stand mixers but not manufactured by Kitchenaid/ Cuisinart. ※Not manufactured or sold by Kitchenaid 【Multifunction Pasta Maker Set】Pasta roller sheet has 8 setting adjustment knobs, electric pasta makers can be adjusted through the knobs. Roll the dough, use Spaghetti cutter and Fettuccine cutter to cut into spaghetti and fettuccine. By adjusting the roller knob, you can enrich your own recipes: Ravioli, Melaleuca, Tortellini, Dumplings, Empanadas, Lasagna, Noodles. 【Stainless Steel Material】Kitchenaid mixer accessories for KitchenAid are made of 304 stainless steel, including pasta roller, spaghetti cutter and fettuccine cutter. Stainless steel has high stability and ability to cut noodles, provides uniform power for making pasta, and improves the taste of pasta. 【Easy to Use and Clean】It is very easy to install and use these kitchen aid pasta maker assecories on the stand mixers. It can be washed by water, but please dry it after washing. Cleaning Brush provided to easily remove bits of flour and pasta, you can also clean by dry soft towels and let it dry naturally. Do not clean it in the dishwasher or do not sanitize it in disinfection cabinet. 【Better After-Sale Guarantee】Make quick and easy work of fresh homemade pasta in your kitchen using the kitchenaid mixer attachments at home! Is a great gift for Parents, Friends, Wife, Husband, Christmas, New Year. ※ It comes with 1-Month Free Trial & 1-Year Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TLQ-abzPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Airpro","source_asin":"B0BRMMMW24","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-590922","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRMMMW24","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRMMMW24","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
